            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Tamil for a governor, then the Tamil for a parliament."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: தேர்தல்",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தேர்தல் — tērtal — \"an election\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அடுத்த மாதம் தேர்தல் நடக்கும். aṭutta mātam tērtal naṭakkum. The election will be held next month."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "From தேர், to choose, as in தேர்ந்தெடு, + -தல், the verbal noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "தேர்தல் (tērtal) is native: the verbal noun in -தல் of tēr, \"to examine, consider, choose\" (DEDR 3419), the verb inside தேர்ந்தெடு."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
