              "instruction": "aṭutta mātam tērtal naṭakkum. — The election will be held next month.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *aṭutta mātam tērtal naṭakkum.* — The election will be held next month.]"
